OL,3,AVoy at-home test kit adverts banned
OL,4,Aover low testosterone claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive adverts by online healthcare
OL,7,Fprovider Voy have been banned by the
OL,8,Fwatchdog for making misleading claims
OL,9,Flinked to low testosterone in men.
OL,11,FThe Advertising Standards Authority
OL,12,F(ASA) said the adverts promoted Voy's
OL,13,Fat-home testosterone blood tests in
OL,14,Fthree posters and two paid-for Facebook
OL,15,Fads.
OL,17,FIt said they were misleading as they
OL,18,Flinked common symptoms such as
OL,19,Firritability and fatigue to low
OL,20,Ftestosterone.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
